AI: 
                                   Root Cause                                   

Pod postgres-594bbc787f-5nfb7 is in CrashLoopBackOff (11 restarts) because the  
POSTGRES_PASSWORD environment variable is empty. PostgreSQL requires a non-empty
password value to initialize the database.                                      

Evidence:                                                                       

 • Pod logs show: Error: Database is uninitialized and superuser password is not
   specified. You must specify POSTGRES_PASSWORD to a non-empty value           
 • Deployment spec shows POSTGRES_PASSWORD env var with no value set            
 • Container exits immediately with code 1                                      
 • Readiness probe never succeeds because PostgreSQL never starts               

Configuration drift: The deployment's last-applied-configuration annotation     
shows the original config had POSTGRES_PASSWORD set to "sekret", but the current
running spec has it empty—indicating the deployment was edited/patched          
incorrectly.                                                                    


                                      Fix                                       

Restore the password value:                                                     

                                                                                
 kubectl set env deployment/postgres -n shop POSTGRES_PASSWORD=sekret           
                                                                                

Or use a Secret (recommended):                                                  

                                                                                
 kubectl create secret generic postgres-secret -n shop                          
 --from-literal=POSTGRES_PASSWORD=your-secure-password                          
 kubectl set env deployment/postgres -n shop --from=secret/postgres-secret      
                                                                                

The pod will restart automatically and become ready once the password is set.   
