AI: 
                                   Root Cause                                   

Pod worker-7496d4d8b-w5tpw is crash looping because it cannot reach the postgres
database. The worker container exits with code 1 when the connection check      
fails.                                                                          

Logs from last 15 minutes (4 total):                                            

                                                                                
 Tue Aug 18 07:13:58 UTC 2026 worker: cannot reach postgres                     
                                                                                


                                Underlying Issue                                

The postgres dependency (postgres-594bbc787f-5nfb7) is also crash looping.      
Postgres fails immediately on startup because POSTGRES_PASSWORD environment     
variable is empty.                                                              

Postgres error:                                                                 

                                                                                
 Error: Database is uninitialized and superuser password is not specified.      
        You must specify POSTGRES_PASSWORD to a non-empty value for the         
        superuser.                                                              
                                                                                

The postgres pod descriptor shows:                                              

                                                                                
 Environment:                                                                   
   POSTGRES_PASSWORD:                                                           
                                                                                


                                      Fix                                       

Set a non-empty value for POSTGRES_PASSWORD in the postgres deployment:         

                                                                                
 kubectl set env deployment/postgres -n shop POSTGRES_PASSWORD=<secure-password 
                                                                                

Or patch the deployment YAML to include:                                        

                                                                                
 env:                                                                           
   - name: POSTGRES_PASSWORD                                                    
     value: "<secure-password>"  # or use a Secret reference                    
                                                                                

Once postgres starts successfully, the worker pod will connect and stop         
crashing.                                                                       
