AI: 
                                   Root Cause                                   

The postgres deployment rollout is stuck because the pod is crashing immediately
on startup due to a missing required password.                                  

Issue: POSTGRES_PASSWORD environment variable is set but empty (no value).      
PostgreSQL requires a non-empty password for the superuser when initializing a  
new database.                                                                   

Evidence from logs (last 40 minutes):                                           

                                                                                
 Error: Database is uninitialized and superuser password is not specified.      
        You must specify POSTGRES_PASSWORD to a non-empty value for the         
        superuser.                                                              
                                                                                

Current state:                                                                  

 • Pod postgres-594bbc787f-5nfb7 in CrashLoopBackOff (11 restarts)              
 • Exit code: 1                                                                 
 • Deployment condition: ProgressDeadlineExceeded (stuck for 35+ minutes)       
 • 0/1 replicas available                                                       


                                      Fix                                       

Set a valid password for POSTGRES_PASSWORD:                                     

                                                                                
 kubectl set env deployment/postgres -n shop                                    
 POSTGRES_PASSWORD=<your-secure-password>                                       
                                                                                

Or use a Secret:                                                                

                                                                                
 kubectl create secret generic postgres-secret -n shop                          
 --from-literal=POSTGRES_PASSWORD=<your-secure-password>                        
 kubectl patch deployment postgres -n shop -p                                   
 '{"spec":{"template":{"spec":{"containers":[{"name":"postgres","env":[{"name": 
 OSTGRES_PASSWORD","valueFrom":{"secretKeyRef":{"name":"postgres-secret","key": 
 OSTGRES_PASSWORD"}}}]}]}}}}'                                                   
                                                                                
