AI: 
                              Root Cause Analysis                               

Pod api-5d46ddb744-4drng in namespace shop is not ready due to CrashLoopBackOff 
caused by a dependency failure.                                                 

                                 Primary Issue                                  

The api pod repeatedly crashes (11 restarts) because it cannot connect to the   
postgres service. Logs show:                                                    

                                                                                
 Tue Aug 18 07:18:04 UTC 2026 api: cannot reach postgres                        
                                                                                

The pod's health check script (nc -z -w 2 postgres 5432) fails and exits with   
code 1, triggering continuous restarts.                                         

                                   Root Cause                                   

The postgres pod (postgres-594bbc787f-5nfb7) is also in CrashLoopBackOff (12    
restarts) and failing immediately on startup with:                              

                                                                                
 Error: Database is uninitialized and superuser password is not specified.      
 You must specify POSTGRES_PASSWORD to a non-empty value for the superuser.     
                                                                                

The postgres deployment has POSTGRES_PASSWORD set to an empty string in its     
environment configuration, violating PostgreSQL's security requirements.        

                                      Fix                                       

Set a non-empty password for the postgres deployment:                           

                                                                                
 kubectl set env deployment/postgres -n shop POSTGRES_PASSWORD=<secure-password 
                                                                                

Or use a Secret:                                                                

                                                                                
 kubectl create secret generic postgres-secret -n shop                          
 --from-literal=POSTGRES_PASSWORD=<secure-password>                             
 # Then update deployment to reference the secret                               
                                                                                

Once postgres starts successfully, the api pod will be able to connect and      
become ready.                                                                   
